es (PubMed:16269826). Binds phosphoinositides (PubMed:19168031)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}